<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh to tender to buy 50,000 tonnes of sugar.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh to tender to buy 50,000 tonnes of sugar.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banagladesh's state-owned Sugar and Food Corporation has tendered for 50,000 tonnes of white sugar, corporation officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>They said the corporation would float two tenders for 25,000 tonnes each shortly. The first tender for 25,000 tonnes is expected by the end of this month, they said without giving details.</p>
